{"id":"e88d3edb906e9454","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-turing-machine.md","title":"Deterministic Turing Machines","display":"df-turing-machine — Deterministic Turing Machines","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-turing-machine","aliases":["68-df-turing-machine"],"display":"df-turing-machine — Deterministic Turing Machines","depends_on":["[[68-df-natural-number]]"],"source_location":"Local reconstruction of missing interfaces from the supplied 68 archive; original external text unavailable","verification_status":"local-formalization-reviewed","source_proof_status":"not-proof-assistant-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-turing-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine — Deterministic Turing Machines"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3368c1852f2a1aa0\" href=\"?note=3368c1852f2a1aa0\" title=\"68-df-natural-number\">68-df-natural-number</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local reconstruction of missing interfaces from the supplied 68 archive; original external text unavailable"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 是整数集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为机器元组候选。机器的八个分量顺序固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\">\\((Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\)</span>：状态、输入字母表、带字母表、转移函数、初态、成功终态、拒绝终态、空白符。所有状态和字母都是自然数标识；移动量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1,0,1\">\\(-1,0,1\\)</span> 是整数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为下式定义的一元谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr M_{68}\">\\(\\mathscr M_{68}\\)</span> 是合法机器集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr U_{68}:=\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b):Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\delta\\subseteq(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\times(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\{-1,0,1\\})\\land q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathscr U_{68}:=\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b):Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\delta\\subseteq(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\times(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\{-1,0,1\\})\\land q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}(M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land |Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{q_0,q_a,q_r\\}\\subseteq Q\\land|\\{q_0,q_a,q_r\\}|=3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\delta\\in\\bigl(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}\\bigr)^{(Q\\setminus\\{q_a,q_r\\})\\times\\Gamma}\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TM}(M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land |Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{q_0,q_a,q_r\\}\\subseteq Q\\land|\\{q_0,q_a,q_r\\}|=3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\delta\\in\\bigl(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}\\bigr)^{(Q\\setminus\\{q_a,q_r\\})\\times\\Gamma}\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr M_{68}:=\\{M\\in\\mathscr U_{68}:\\mathrm{TM}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathscr M_{68}:=\\{M\\in\\mathscr U_{68}:\\mathrm{TM}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原压缩包仅引用第 88 本不存在的八元组定义，未提供其正文。本文件给出本地确定性、单带、双向无限纸带模型的完整机器接口；八元组各分量次序是本次明确选定的约定，不冒称恢复了缺失文件原文。非终态转移全定义，两个终态的吸收行为在计算文件中定义。输入/输出编码不属于机器谓词，由计算接口单独固定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"3368c1852f2a1aa0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-natural-number]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)","display":false},{"tex":"-1,0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr M_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr U_{68}:=\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b):Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\delta\\subseteq(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\times(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\{-1,0,1\\})\\land q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}(M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\\\\n&\\land |Q|<\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|<\\aleph_0\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\\\\n&\\land\\{q_0,q_a,q_r\\}\\subseteq Q\\land|\\{q_0,q_a,q_r\\}|=3\\\\\n&\\land\\delta\\in\\bigl(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}\\bigr)^{(Q\\setminus\\{q_a,q_r\\})\\times\\Gamma}\n\\end{aligned}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathscr M_{68}:=\\{M\\in\\mathscr U_{68}:\\mathrm{TM}(M)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2212,"backlinks":[{"id":"d3c982f03a066db1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\in\\mathscr M_{68}$，且 $\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma$。机器集合见 [[68-df-turing-machine]]；有限序列连接与 $\\mathcal F_k$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$q,q'\\in Q$，$h,z\\in\\mathbb Z$，$c\\in\\Gamma$，$d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}$，$k,t,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$，$w\\in\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$。$\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b)$ 是纸带，$\\Delta_M$ 的定义域和值域均为 $\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M)$；$C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,\\cdot)$ 是配置序列。$\\operatorname{In}_{68}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$，$\\operatorname{Out}_{68}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}$ 是数值偏函数图。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-machine]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-machine]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"图灵机、运行和可计算函数的定义已经存在于本次附件中，分别见 [[68-df-turing-machine]]、[[68-df-turing-machine-computation]]、[[68-df-turing-computable-function]]。本轮逐一解析原包文件目标与历史别名，未发现显式悬空文件链接，不将原包关于先前缺失第 88 本正文的历史说明误当作当前数学前提。原包此前已将旧 Church–Turing 条目中的过时外部证明要求改为 [[68-thm-turing-recursive-equivalence]] 的本地依赖；保留的等式入口为 [[68-cor-turing-recursive-class-equality]]。"}],"outgoing":["3368c1852f2a1aa0"]}